OL,3,GNEWSA'I was given electric shocks to
OL,4,Aknock the homosexuality out of my
OL,5,Abrain'
OL,6,
OL,7,FMore victims of controversial electric
OL,8,Fshock therapy used to try to change
OL,9,Ftheir sexuality have come forward to
OL,10,Fcall on the government to investigate
OL,11,Fthe historical "scandal".
OL,13,FThey spoke out after the BBC revealed
OL,14,Fthat more than 260 people had been
OL,15,Fsubjected to the discredited treatment
OL,16,Fat NHS hospitals in the 1960s and
OL,17,F1970s.
OL,19,FThe people, who are now in their 70s
OL,20,Fand 80s, said they had been left
OL,21,Fphysically and emotionally traumatised
OL,22,Fby their experiences.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,408,400,260,160,0,100
